### Fetch a lease contract
GET http://localhost:8080/contract/{{id}}


### Fetch all contracts
GET http://localhost:8080/contract

### Create Lease Contract
POST http://localhost:8080/contract
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "lesseeName": "John Doe",
  "lessorName": "ACME Corp",
  "principalAmount": 10000.00,
  "leaseAmount": 12000.00,
  "interestRate": 5.5,
  "leaseStartDate": "2024-01-01",
  "leaseEndDate": "2025-01-01"
}



